{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multimodal model with ResNet50 image encoder, no aggregation, and concat fusion, replacing the PCA RNA encoder from prior experiments. Validation accuracy improved slightly to 0.5362 (from 0.5266) and F1 increased to 0.5158 (from 0.5104), suggesting a potential benefit of the advanced RNA encoder. However, the effectiveness of concat fusion and the precise impact of RNA encoder choice remain uncertain without further comparative analysis."
}

